From a57e7677e72e727e941218367514fdcfb5c51375 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aspen <aspeninifeltner@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:25:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Zarchive loading (#724): launcher side

Launcher half of upstream KytyPS5 commit 4b0de1b6: detect .zar archives in the
game folders, read param.json and icons from them, and start them via --game.
add_game keeps this branch's custom-settings handling; the upstream size
column and running-row refresh are not part of this branch and are left out.
Not compiled (no Qt available when ported).

(cherry picked from commit 4b0de1b6)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
